== Death ==
Only time is lost when defeated in the Fight screen; all progression, gold, and levels remain intact when a player visits Death's screen. Here the player will be healed incrementally until they are fully revived in a short period of time. Additionally, skills may be used on this screen, but the Heal skill does not expedite the revival process.

[[File:Death.png|left]]Coincidentally, Death's Reaper has a health bar and using skills can eventually kill it to unlock a [https://idle-skilling.fandom.com/wiki/Secrets?so=search#Death's_Son secret area]. However, in order to be [[Secrets|rewarded]], this must be done before the player is revived, making it a difficult feat until many levels later.
==Skills==
Abilities and buffs can be unlocked through [[Perks tree|Perks]]. The damage or duration of a skill can be enhanced by upgrading their respective [[Perks tree|perks]], equipping certain [[Cards]] and [[Tinkering]] equipment. Additionally, the cooldown can be reduced by the Excellent Timing [[Ascension#AP Perk Tree|Ascension Perk]] after clearing the The Mist. There's also an option to autocast skills, which can be unlocked and upgraded through the Gift Shop in [[Raids]].

