== Fighting Boosts ==
Fighting progress is improved by [[Train]]ing levels, [[Smithing]] trinkets, equipped [[Cards]], [[Tinkering]] gear, several [[Summoning#Rifts|Rifts]], and bonuses from [[Perks tree|Perks]] and [[Ascension#AP Perk Tree|Ascension]]. Since there are too many sources for damage and attack speed bonuses to create a short list, here are unique and notable bonuses instead:

===Kill Count Increase===
Increasing the amount each monster kill contributes to the required kill limit helps to clear zones faster.
*After clearing Desert, the Monster Decimation [[Ascension]] Perk becomes accessible, granting +0.1 value per kill. However, this is a very expensive perk to upgrade.
*The [[Secrets#Death's Son|Death's Son secret]] grants +30% more kills when defeating monsters, which is further multiplied by crafted Enigmatic Boosters, a level 40 [[Smithing]] item.
*The level 120 [[Smithing]] Ensouled Head grants Kills per Kill (caps at +10).
*After clearing Dungeon, [[Rebirth]] has the upgrade '''Skull Crusher''' that grants 10n% extra kills per level.
*Keymaster O and Incarnate A [[cards]] grants more kills and the Gorshank Z card increases kills/kill.
===Monster Cash Increase===
More gold from enemies makes it easier to level up more skills, and more skills generally mean better Fighting progression.
*After clearing Desert, the Monster Laundering and Desert Collector [[Ascension]] Perks become accessible, granting +50% more gold per level and +(0.2n)% cash for every Desert card level, respectively.
*The Petty Theft (+2% per level), Pilfering (+3% per level), Plunder Meister (+6% per level), Looter Lord (+10% per level), and Lightning Larceny (+40% per level) trinkets from [[Smithing]] all grant bonus gold from enemies.
*The Desert Yellow Phat (+10%), Desert Baron (+12%), Mountains Blue Phat (+15%), Noob (+25%), Keymaster L (+20%), Maelstrom Cheezers (+5%), Clodd (+6%), Anodesia (+7%), Firechad (8%), Youre Epic (+30%), Incarnate G (+59%), Crusades Limpy (+12%), Crusades Minty (+25% From Midas), Nightmare Entertainer (+60%) and Emigdala Y (+50%) [[Cards]] all gives bonus gold from monsters.
*The level 20 [[Tinkering]] Trojan Helmet grants +50% gold, and the level 79 Cash Money necklace grants +600% gold. After opening Tink Time,Tinkolicious from [[Construction]] you can acces 3rd stat line on tinkering equipments.Items grants gold with 3rd line stat on tinkering; Level 1 Wooden Spear grants +200% gold and Blobulytes necklace grants +500% gold.
*After first ascend you can access [[Hatchery|pets]], ID 7 Sheep grants +20% cash per passive level, ID 25 Djinn grants +50% cash per passive level, ID 56 Golden Boy grants +80% cash per passive level.
